# The window title and the game process's threads and memory, on the title screen, the setup screen and the board
# Steps are described in runtime/iwp/spike/steps.py. Coordinates are the 800x600 stage's.
# Run with: cycle.py --experiment E002 --arm probe-process --script experiments/E002-iwp-state-inventory/scripts/probe-process.steps --terminate kill
title
proc
click 100 585        # New Game
settle
title
proc
shot setup
click! 565 532       # Play Game
shot board-loading
watch 0 0 800 495
settle 4             # the computer players take their turns first; the board is quiet when it is Blue's
title
proc
shot board
changes
